he became completely pro-life.

00:33:38.950 --> 00:33:40.518
Romney had been for gun control,

00:33:40.518 --> 00:33:42.520
he became a lifetime
member of the NRA.

00:33:43.421 --> 00:33:44.989
Romney was for gay rights.

00:33:46.357 --> 00:33:49.994 align:start size:97% position:3%
Romney was then totally
against even basic gay rights.

00:33:49.994 --> 00:33:52.430 align:start size:84% position:16%
